@baseUrl = http://localhost:5002
@orderId = <POST /orders yanıtındaki id'yi buraya yapıştırın>

### Ürünleri listele
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Sipariş oluştur (201 + { "id": "..." })
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Bilinmeyen ürün (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "items": [ { "productId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Boş sipariş (409 - en az 1 kalem)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "items": [] }

### Siparişleri listele
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### Sipariş getir (200 / 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### Kargola (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/ship

### İptal et (204, kargolanmışsa 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
